
# 🔐 Secure Multi-Modal Data Encryption & OTP Authentication System

 📌 Overview

This project is a Django-based secure data encryption system that supports:

* Image encryption & decryption
* Text encryption using image steganography concepts
* Audio generation from encoded images
* OTP-based user registration system
* Role-based authentication (Admin & User)

It focuses on data security, steganography, and secure communication systems.

---

 🚀 Problem Statement

With increasing digital data exchange, securing sensitive information is critical.

This system solves:

* Lack of secure data hiding techniques
* Weak authentication systems
* Unsafe file transmission
* Limited multi-modal encryption tools

---

 🧠 Core Concepts Used

* OTP-based email verification
* Image steganography (data hiding in images)
* Audio reconstruction from encoded images
* Secure password generation
* Session-based authentication

---

 🛠️ Tech Stack

 Backend

* Django

 Frontend

* HTML
* CSS
* Bootstrap

 Libraries Used

* NumPy
* Pillow (PIL)
* SciPy
* OS module
* Django Email System

---

 🔐 Features

 👤 User Module

* OTP-based registration via email
* Secure login system
* Profile management
* Upload images, text, and audio
* Encrypt and decrypt data
* Submit feedback

---

 🛠️ Admin Module

* View all users
* Activate / deactivate users
* Monitor feedbacks
* Manage system activity

---

 🖼️ Image Encryption

* Hide data inside images
* Key-based encryption system
* Secure image upload & storage
* Decryption using stored key

---

 🔊 Audio Generation System

* Extract encoded pixel values from images
* Convert RGB data into audio signals
* Generate `.wav` file dynamically
* Downloadable output audio

---

 📝 Text Encryption

* Convert text into encoded image format
* Decode hidden text from images
* Secure steganography-based communication

---

 📧 OTP Authentication System

* Email-based OTP verification
* Auto-generated secure password
* Session-based registration flow
* Prevents fake user registration

---

 ⚙️ System Workflow

1. User registers with email
2. OTP sent to email
3. Password auto-generated and shared
4. User logs in securely
5. User uploads image/text/audio
6. Data is encrypted using backend logic
7. System allows decryption or audio generation

---

 📊 Key Highlights

* Multi-modal encryption system (Image + Text + Audio)
* Secure authentication with OTP verification
* Real-time file processing
* Steganography-based data hiding
* Downloadable encrypted outputs

---

 🔮 Future Improvements

* Add AES/RSA hybrid encryption
* Cloud-based secure storage
* AI-based steganalysis detection
* Mobile application support
* Real-time secure messaging system

